msgid "How tasks, tickets, credits and standing work, by email and Telegram, once to each member. Organizers also get the organizer guide. New members get it when they confirm their email; everyone else from the hourly run, inside the notification hours, 25 people per hour. Use \"Send me the welcome message\" below to check it first."
